 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nThamesview Logistics Ltd                                   MASTER SERVICES\n221 Baker Street, LS1 4DY Leeds, United Kingdom           AGREEMENT\nVAT No: GB061268939\nReg No: GB-944890\n\nFROM                                                      BILL TO\nThamesview Logistics Ltd                                  Westbrook Pharma Ltd\n221 Baker Street                                          221 Baker Street\nLS1 4DY Leeds                                             BS1 5TR Bristol\nUnited Kingdom                                            United Kingdom\nVAT: GB061268939\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 21/04/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Thamesview\nLogistics Ltd, with its registered office at 221 Baker Street, Leeds (\"Party A\"), and Westbrook Pharma Ltd, with its registered office at 221\nBaker Street, Bristol (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 24 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of England and Wales.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A      Thamesview Logistics Ltd / Oliver Bennett\nParty B      Westbrook Pharma Ltd / Amelia Clarke\nDate         21/04/2026",
